WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:09.476 line:78%
SPILLING RUSSIA'S WAR IN UKRAINE

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.744 line:78%
SETTING OFF FEARS OF

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:12.112 line:78%
WORLD WAR III AFTER A MISSILE

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:13.880 line:78%
HIT POLAND NEAR THE UKRAINIAN

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.714 line:78%
BORDER KILLING TWO PEOPLE,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.915 line:78%
REPORTS INITIALLY CLAIMED IT WAS

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:18.885 line:78%
A RUSSIAN ATTACK AND NOW THE

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:21.388 line:78%
CONSENSUS IS THAT IT WAS LIKELY

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:21.721 line:78%
CAUSED BY UKRAINE'S AIR DEFENSE

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:22.455 line:78%
SYSTEM.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.490 line:78%
PRESIDENT BITING ADDRESSING THE

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:27.660 line:78%
ISSUE AFTER IT HAPPENED.

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:28.361 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THERE IS GLENN MARY

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:29.662 line:78%
INFORMATION TO CONTEST THAT I

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:36.403 line:78%
DON'T WANT TO SAY THAT UNTIL WE

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:39.506 line:78%
COMPLETELY INVESTIGATE.

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.507 line:78%
AND IT'S UNLIKELY IN THE MINDS

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:44.044 line:78%
OF THE TRAJECTORY THAT IT WAS

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:45.712 line:78%
FIRED FROM RUSSIA.

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.447 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: LUCKY TO AVOID

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.648 line:78%
ARMAGEDDON, BUT THAT'S NOT

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.950 line:78%
STOPPING JOE BIDEN FROM ASKING

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:54.454 line:78%
CONGRESS FOR ANOTHER $37 BILLION

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.221 line:78%
TO KEEP WARREN UKRAINE, AND TOP

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.690 line:78%
MILITARY OFFICERS EXPECTING THE

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:59.492 line:78%
U.S. SUPPORT TO CONTINUE.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:01.461 line:78%
&gt;&gt; RUSSIA COULD PUT AN END TO IT

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:04.130 line:78%
RIGHT NOW, BUT THEY WON'T.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:05.565 line:78%
AND WE, THE UNITED STATES, UNDER

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:06.433 line:78%
THE DIRECTION OF THE PRESIDENT

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:07.267 line:78%
AND THE SECRETARY OF DEFENSE

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:12.038 line:78%
WILL CONTINUE TO SUPPORT UKRAINE

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:13.273 line:78%
FOR AS LONG AS IT TAKES TO KEEP

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:15.675 line:78%
THEM FREE, SOVEREIGN,

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:17.343 line:78%
INDEPENDENT WITH THEIR TERRITORY

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:18.411 line:78%
INTACT.

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:21.681 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: DANA PERINO, ARE WE

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:22.582 line:78%
GETTING CLOSER TO WORLD WAR III?

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:24.384 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dana: NO, HOPEFULLY.

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:25.852 line:78%
I THINK THAT THERE ARE A COUPLE

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:27.921 line:78%
OF THINGS COULD COOLER HEADS

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:29.722 line:78%
PREVAILED, THAT'S ALWAYS GOOD.

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:31.091 line:78%
AND IT'S NOT REALLY IN RUSSIA'S

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.859 line:78%
BEST INTEREST RIGHT NOW TO

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:34.127 line:78%
ATTACK A NATO COUNTRY, AND I

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.929 line:78%
ALSO THINK OF RUSSIA WERE

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:37.464 line:78%
ACTUALLY GOING TO MAKE A

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:41.301 line:78%
DECISION TO ATTACK A NATO

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:42.035 line:78%
COUNTRY, IT WOULD NOT BE TOO

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.969 line:78%
UNFORTUNATELY KILLED TWO FARMERS

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.637 line:78%
IN POLAND.

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:47.240 line:78%
I THINK THAT THAT WOULD BE A

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:52.479 line:78%
WHOLE DIFFERENT THING.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:53.713 line:78%
AND THE ADMINISTRATION,

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:54.914 line:78%
$3.7 MILLION AND THEY WANT TO

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:56.349 line:78%
GET IT DONE AND THE LAME DUCK

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:57.050 line:78%
IT, AND I UNDERSTAND WHY THEY

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.718 line:78%
DO, BECAUSE THINGS WILL CHANGE

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:00.920 line:78%
IN JANUARY WHEN YOU HAVE A NEW

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.588 line:78%
CONGRESS, BUT THE ONE THING

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.890 line:78%
PRESIDENT BIDEN DOES NOT DO

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:04.958 line:78%
ENOUGH IN MY OPINION IS

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.893 line:78%
EXPLAINED TO THE UNITED STATES

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:07.193 line:78%
WHY IS IT AND OUR INTEREST TO DO

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.528 line:78%
THIS.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:10.130 line:78%
AND IF YOU MAKE THE CASE, THEN

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:11.030 line:78%
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE ARE

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.132 line:78%
GENEROUS, WE CARE ABOUT FREEDOM

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:14.167 line:78%
AND OUR NATIONAL SECURITY AND

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:15.301 line:78%
TAKE CARE OF THINGS AT HOME, BUT

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.836 line:78%
YOU HAVE TO EXPLAIN THAT COME

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:19.772 line:78%
YOU CAN'T JUST TRYING TO PASS

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:20.173 line:78%
THESE BILLS WITHOUT MORE OF AN

00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:22.242 line:78%
EXPLANATION.

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:25.145 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: GREG GUTFELD.

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:25.945 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dana: THANK YOU.

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:26.946 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: GREG GUTFELD HAS A

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:29.082 line:78%
LOT OF PLANS FOR THE LAME DUCK.

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:30.116 line:78%
ARE YOU PLANNING ON SPENDING

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:32.685 line:78%
THAT MUCH MONEY ON UKRAINE?

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:33.820 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: HERE IS THE THING.

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:35.021 line:78%
I DON'T TRUST ANYTHING COMING

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.722 line:78%
OUT OF RUSSIA.

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:36.890 line:78%
I DON'T TRUST ANYTHING OUT OF

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:37.924 line:78%
THE UKRAINE.

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:39.826 line:78%
I DON'T TRUST ANYTHING COMING

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:40.827 line:78%
OUT OF THE UNITED STATES.

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:41.728 line:78%
SORRY.

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:42.295 line:78%
WE HAVE BEEN LIED TO ABOUT

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:44.097 line:78%
COVID.

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.497 line:78%
WE HAVE BEEN LIED TO ABOUT

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:45.865 line:78%
AFGHANISTAN.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.332 line:78%
WE HAVE BEEN LIED TO ABOUT A

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:49.269 line:78%
RACK.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:51.171 line:78%
WHAT ELSE HAVE WE BEEN LIED TO?

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:51.671 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WERE LIED TO ABOUT

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:52.438 line:78%
YOUR ROOM.

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:54.841 line:78%
IT &gt;&gt; Greg: I WAS LIED TO

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:55.942 line:78%
ABOUT MY ROOM!

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:56.676 line:78%
BUT IT IS INTERESTING THAT WE

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:59.112 line:78%
HAVE NOT REALLY COVER THE STORY

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:02.715 line:78%
IN MONTHS.

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:04.984 line:78%
AND IT'S LIKE WE GOT USED TO IT,

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:06.886 line:78%
200,000 PEOPLE DEAD, 100

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:08.321 line:78%
TROOPS -- 100,000 ON EACH SIDE

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.756 line:78%
MAY BE MORE, AND IT'S JUST

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:11.057 line:78%
BACKGROUND NOISE AND IT'S KIND

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:15.461 line:78%
OF SAD, BECAUSE THERE IS A WAR

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:16.095 line:78%
GOING ON, BUT THERE IS A WAR OF

00:03:15.562 --> 00:03:17.664 line:78%
PERSUASION AND WAR OF

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:20.500 line:78%
PROPAGANDA, AND WHEN THAT

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:22.268 line:78%
GENERAL SAYS FOR AS LONG AS IT

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.936 line:78%
TAKES, WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?

00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:25.772 line:78%
WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:26.072 line:78%
IT MEANS IT IS NO SKIN OFF OUR

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:26.673 line:78%
NECKS.

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:28.107 line:78%
WE DON'T NOTICE IT.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:29.742 line:78%
SO IT COULD GO ON FOREVER.

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:31.177 line:78%
AND YOU ARE SEEING ONE OF THE

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.711 line:78%
MOST BEAUTIFUL COUNTRIES IN THE

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:35.114 line:78%
WORLD GET DESTROYED.

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:37.517 line:78%
SO IT'S A SAD STORY.

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:39.052 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: JUDGE JEANINE, DO

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:41.120 line:78%
YOU TRUST JOE BIDEN AS THE

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:42.655 line:78%
COMMANDER-IN-CHIEF TO GUIDE US?

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:43.756 line:78%
SPILLING DON'T FINISH THE

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.090 line:78%
QUESTION, YOU KNOW IT'S NO

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:45.425 line:78%
ALREADY.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:47.660 line:78%
HERE'S THE THING, I AGREE WITH

00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:49.395 line:78%
GREG.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.297 line:78%
I DON'T -- THIS IS ONE TIME

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.631 line:78%
WHERE I HOPE THAT THEY ARE

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:54.300 line:78%
LYING.

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:56.936 line:78%
IF IT DID COME FROM RUSSIA OKAY,

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.770 line:78%
I WANT THEM TO TELL ME THAT IT

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:59.339 line:78%
DIDN'T, BECAUSE I DON'T WANT TO

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.406 line:78%
TRIGGER WORLD WAR III, SO

00:03:59.439 --> 00:04:03.276 line:78%
HOPEFULLY THEY ARE LYING ABOUT

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:05.545 line:78%
THAT IF IT DID END UP COMING

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:07.313 line:78%
FROM RUSSIA.

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:12.452 line:78%
PLUS $37 BILLION.

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:14.420 line:78%
YOU ADD THAT TO $19.3 BILLION,

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:15.021 line:78%
WHAT ARE WE BUYING?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:18.925 line:78%
WHERE'S THE MONEY GOING?

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:22.262 line:78%
I DON'T LIKE IT WHEN I HEAR SAM

00:04:19.025 --> 00:04:23.062 line:78%
BANK MEN'S NAME CONNECTED TO

00:04:22.362 --> 00:04:24.264 line:78%
UKRAINE.

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:24.564 line:78%
THERE'S TOO MUCH CASH OVER

00:04:24.364 --> 00:04:26.899 line:78%
THERE.

00:04:24.664 --> 00:04:27.467 line:78%
AND IF WE WANT TO SEND WEAPONS,

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.435 line:78%
SEND WEAPONS.

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:29.969 line:78%
DON'T SEND CASH.

00:04:29.602 --> 00:04:35.575 line:78%
I DON'T LIKE IT.

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:37.010 line:78%
IT STINKS TO HIGH HELL.

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:41.014 line:78%
[CHEERS AND APPLAUSE]

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.681 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: YOUR GUIDE

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:44.851 line:78%
JOE BIDEN.

00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:47.020 line:78%
HEY, HAROLD, HOW ARE YOU DOING.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:47.487 line:78%
IS HE NAVIGATING THIS THING

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.155 line:78%
PROPERLY?

00:04:47.587 --> 00:04:51.691 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: I LIKED THE NIGHT

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:52.392 line:78%
WE HAD LAST WEEK, DID YOU?

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:52.725 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Judge Jeanine: TUESDAY

00:04:52.492 --> 00:04:54.394 line:78%
NIGHT.

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:54.694 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WHEN WE TOOK THE

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:58.097 line:78%
HOUSE?

00:04:54.794 --> 00:05:02.101 line:78%
YOU LIKE THAT NIGHT.

00:04:58.197 --> 00:05:03.236 line:78%
YORTY HAD THE SENATE.

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:03.536 line:78%
AND YOU BOUGHT IT WITH FUNNY

00:05:03.336 --> 00:05:05.972 line:78%
MONEY.

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:08.708 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: I COVERED THE

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:10.443 line:78%
SPREAD.

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:12.111 line:78%
AND I TRADE BETWEEN RUSSIA AND

00:05:10.543 --> 00:05:14.280 line:78%
VLADIMIR PUTIN, THEY ARE GREAT

00:05:12.412 --> 00:05:15.014 line:78%
PEOPLE WITH GREAT HISTORY.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:18.251 line:78%
VLADIMIR PUTIN HAS SABOTAGED THE

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:19.752 line:78%
WAY THAT HE IS GOING ABOUT THIS

00:05:18.351 --> 00:05:23.122 line:78%
INVASION INTO UKRAINE, IF WE DID

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:24.857 line:78%
NOT ACT IN SOME WAY, IF WE DID

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:26.492 line:78%
NOT CHALLENGE IT IN SOME WAY,

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:27.694 line:78%
HISTORY WOULD SHOW THAT WE

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:29.662 line:78%
PERHAPS APPROVE IT.

00:05:27.794 --> 00:05:30.430 line:78%
FURTHERMORE IN MY MIND, I DON'T

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:30.963 line:78%
THINK THAT PUTIN WOULD'VE

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:32.632 line:78%
STOPPED IN UKRAINE.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.366 line:78%
HE HAS GIVEN A SERIES OF

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:38.104 line:78%
SPEECHES OVER THE LAST THREE OR

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:39.639 line:78%
FOUR YEARS WHERE HE HAS LONG FOR

00:05:38.237 --> 00:05:41.307 line:78%
THE USSR AS OUR POLICY AND

00:05:39.739 --> 00:05:44.043 line:78%
THINKERS HELP BREAK UP MANY MEN

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:45.912 line:78%
AND WOMEN, SOME WHOSE PARENTS,

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:47.647 line:78%
SOME KIDS MAY BE CELEBRATING

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:48.348 line:78%
THIS EVENING OR TOMORROW EVENING

00:05:47.747 --> 00:05:49.515 line:78%
WHOSE PARENTS AND GRANDPARENTS

00:05:48.448 --> 00:05:52.685 line:78%
FOUGHT TO WIN THE COLD WAR.

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:54.087 line:78%
THIS IS NOT ABOUT EUROPEAN

00:05:52.785 --> 00:05:54.554 line:78%
SECURITY, BUT THEIR SECURITY IS

00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:57.724 line:78%
TIED TO OURS.

00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:59.659 line:78%
IF WE GET TO 37, IT WILL BE

00:05:57.824 --> 00:06:01.260 line:78%
56 BILLION, NOT AN AMERICAN

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:02.662 line:78%
SOLDIER HAVING AN OPPORTUNITY TO

00:06:01.694 --> 00:06:04.931 line:78%
SEE ALL OF THAT GREAT AMERICAN

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:05.965 line:78%
TECHNOLOGY AND WEAPONRY AT WORK

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:06.833 line:78%
AND HAVE DONE ON-THE-JOB

00:06:06.065 --> 00:06:10.236 line:78%
TRAINING WITH UKRAINIAN SOLDIERS

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:11.504 line:78%
TO DEFEND THEMSELVES.

00:06:10.336 --> 00:06:13.606 line:78%
PUTIN UNDERESTIMATED ONE THING.

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:15.508 line:78%
ONE INCREDIBLY IMPORTANT THING,

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:16.776 line:78%
FIRST HE DID NOT REALIZE THAT

00:06:15.608 --> 00:06:17.910 line:78%
THE UKRAINIAN PEOPLE WANTED TO

00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:19.812 line:78%
DICTATE THEIR FUTURE AND ON

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:20.646 line:78%
THEIR LAND, NOW IS 20% OF THEIR

00:06:19.912 --> 00:06:23.216 line:78%
LAND OCCUPIED.

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:24.484 line:78%
IF THIS 37 BILLION HELPS UKRAINE

00:06:23.316 --> 00:06:25.685 line:78%
OPERATE AND NEGOTIATE FROM A

00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:27.453 line:78%
POSITION OF STRENGTH, BECAUSE

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:28.888 line:78%
THIS WAR HAS TO END WITH A

00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:30.089 line:78%
NEGOTIATED SETTLEMENT.

00:06:28.988 --> 00:06:38.131 line:78%
56 BILLION WILL BE PENNILESS IF

00:06:30.189 --> 00:06:38.865 line:78%
WE ARE ABLE TO DEFEAT PUTIN AND

00:06:38.231 --> 00:06:39.599 line:78%
PUT RUSSIA ON A TRAJECTORY TO BE

00:06:38.965 --> 00:06:40.333 line:78%
SAFE, RELIABLE, DEPENDABLE, AND

00:06:39.699 --> 00:06:41.601 line:78%
FOR THAT MATTER, NOT A THREAT TO

00:06:40.433 --> 00:06:41.768 line:78%
THOSE IN THEIR BACKYARD.

00:06:41.701 --> 00:06:41.768 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jes

